uml:
@startuml
title 2.7 Product, Warehouse and Access Setup (BF-07)

scale 1400 width

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam activityBorderColor #666666
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #FDFDFD
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF4D6
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #888888
skinparam activityArrowColor #666666

|Admin|
start
:Create employee accounts;
:Assign roles and permissions;

|System|
:Validate account information and role mapping;
:Activate user accounts;

|Store Owner|
:Define warehouse structure,\nbranch warehouses, and storage locations;

|System|
:Register warehouse and location master data;

|Store Owner|
:Create product master data;
:Define category, material,\nsize, usage, color code,\npackaging specification,\nand unit conversion;

|System|
:Validate product master data;
:Register product master data;

|Store Owner|
:Create supplier and customer master data;

|System|
:Validate business partner information;
:Activate supplier and customer records;

|Store Owner|
:Create initial lot data if needed;

|System|
:Register lot master data and audit history;

|Admin|
:Review access and configuration readiness;

if (Configuration complete?) then (Yes)
    |System|
    :Publish master data for transaction use;
else (No)
    |Store Owner|
    :Update missing setup information;
    |System|
    :Revalidate configuration;
endif

stop
@enduml
